Scope of this licence

This licence covers the original content of this repository: the
specification text, schemas, quantity registry, reference tools, tests and
the synthetic examples generated by scripts/generate_examples.py.

Datasets, map bundles or other material contributed to or referenced by this
project retain the licence declared by their contributors (for example in the
"package.license" field of a bundle manifest). Inclusion in this repository
does not relicense them under MIT unless the contributor says so explicitly.
